Use updateWithJS to increment a numeric column by mapping each row and adding 1 to the column.
```
import { SimpleDB } from '@nshiab/simple-data-analysis';
// We start a SimpleDB instance
const sdb = new SimpleDB();
// We create a new table
const table = sdb.newTable();
// Load data
await table.loadData('./data.csv');
// Update with JS: increment column1 by 1
await table.updateWithJS((rows) => {
  const modifiedRows = rows.map((d) => ({
    ...d,
    column1: typeof d.column1 === 'number' ? d.column1 + 1 : d.column1,
  }));
  return modifiedRows;
});
// Log the first rows
await table.logTable();
// We close everything
await sdb.done();
```

